 "titulo": "FALDAS BROWNIE SPAIN",
 "fila": null,
 "contenido": "<br />\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjN9op7l5dxcbZCO7RKe1bPsh_ANU4h49wjyxahqjoV9bC5cc8FPDdjthQGejzui4e-lqNMV-29qEqUdfNVQRSrLcIfBmb9AA_xQWtyim2JErS_TzkruMDJy6YCdGpOaJHrYZGrGGZ0QCD0R5HK9IQCJQ6i2R6lvh_GjVuDaafSK_4gPDQuAwgx9HhW6nY/s265/images%20(10).jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"190\" data-original-width=\"265\" height=\"190\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjN9op7l5dxcbZCO7RKe1bPsh_ANU4h49wjyxahqjoV9bC5cc8FPDdjthQGejzui4e-lqNMV-29qEqUdfNVQRSrLcIfBmb9AA_xQWtyim2JErS_TzkruMDJy6YCdGpOaJHrYZGrGGZ0QCD0R5HK9IQCJQ6i2R6lvh_GjVuDaafSK_4gPDQuAwgx9HhW6nY/s1600/images%20(10).jpg\" width=\"265\" /></a></div>La colección Faldas de Brownie reúne diseños versátiles que combinan feminidad, comodidad y un estilo relajado característico de la marca. La propuesta incluye minifaldas, modelos midi y faldas largas con volantes, estampados, tejidos ligeros y detalles artesanales que se adaptan tanto a ocasiones informales como a eventos especiales. Inspiradas en un espíritu juvenil y mediterráneo, estas prendas destacan por su facilidad para crear looks frescos, actuales y desenfadados durante toda la temporada.</div>\n\n<div id=\"tienda-catalogo\"></div>\n<div id=\"sentinel\" style=\"height: 1px;\"></div>\n<div id=\"loader\" style=\"display: block; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">Cargando productos, por favor espera...</div>\n\n<div id=\"web-oficial-container\" style=\"display: none; margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px 0px 40px; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.browniespain.com/es-es/collections/faldas/?utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&amp;utm_medium=boton_oficial&amp;utm_campaign=catalogo_browniespain\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"background: rgb(17, 17, 17); border-radius: 6px; color: white; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 14px 36px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;\" target=\"_blank\">Ir a la web oficial</a>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n#tienda-catalogo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:20px;font-family:Arial;}\n.producto-card{border:1px solid #eaeaea;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;background:#fff;}\n.producto-card img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;}\n.producto-title{font-size:14px;margin:10px 0;font-weight:600;}\n.producto-desc{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin:5px 0;}\n.producto-precio{font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#111;margin:8px 0;}\n.producto-link{display:block;background:#111;color:#fff;padding:10px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px;}\n.producto-club{display:block;background:#e8f0fe;color:#1a73e8;padding:10px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #1a73e8;}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar FORM_URL = 'https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeWdB-lcCJ-K0nsBV6WqB-GZ2ZvA9KkTd798_4n1dmBh1tngA/viewform?usp=pp_url&entry.182236341=';\n// Capa 1: la propia tienda (Shopify, version espanola): catalogo completo, en espanol y con precios de Espana al dia.\n// Capa 2: el proxy Apps Script de siempre, solo si la tienda no responde.\nvar TIENDA = 'https://www.browniespain.com';\nvar COLECCION = TIENDA + '/es-es/collections/faldas/products.json?limit=250';\nvar PROXY = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxo5Q4FNyOpLE4qEDHgZVzdavmxZQMUhQmCak2RjWRNJqQI0uqxcqjgHp2y81mxznFg/exec?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.browniespain.com%2Fes-es%2Fcollections%2Ffaldas&pagina=1';\nvar POR_LOTE = 12;\nvar productos = [], mostrados = 0;\n\nfunction euros(v){ var n = parseFloat(v); return isNaN(n) ? '' : n.toFixed(2).replace('.', ',') + ' €'; }\n\nfunction crearTarjeta(p){\n  var sep = p.url.indexOf('?') !== -1 ? '&' : '?';\n  var utm = sep + 'utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&utm_medium=tarjeta_producto&utm_campaign=catalogo_browniespain';\n  var urlConUtm = p.url + utm;\n  var urlClic = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbymjaZZpelLTpLoZ5t19Y_ppTRW0JH_qbOLxhUHANIH4Yk_OWzCkoXefdSRcQw3qRyu0Q/exec?producto=' + encodeURIComponent(p.titulo) + '&url=' + encodeURIComponent(p.url);\n  var urlForm = FORM_URL + encodeURIComponent(p.titulo);\n  var h = '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-card' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>';\n  if(p.imagen) h += '<img src=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + p.imagen + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' loading=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'lazy' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' referrerpolicy=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'no-referrer' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' alt=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + p.titulo + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>';\n  h += '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-title' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>' + p.titulo + '</div>';\n  if(p.descripcion) h += '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-desc' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>' + p.descripcion + '</div>';\n  if(p.precio) h += '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-precio' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>' + (p.precio_antes ? '<s style=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'color:#999;font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;margin-right:6px' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>' + p.precio_antes + '</s>' : '') + p.precio + '</div>';\n  h += '<a class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-link' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' href=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + urlConUtm + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' rel=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'nofollow' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' target=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '_blank' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' onclick=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'fetch(' + String.fromCharCode(39) + urlClic + String.fromCharCode(39) + ',{mode:' + String.fromCharCode(39) + 'no-cors' + String.fromCharCode(39) + '})' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>Comprar ahora</a>';\n  h += '<a class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-club' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' href=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + urlForm + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' target=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '_blank' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>Unirme al Club de Ahorro</a>';\n  h += '</div>';\n  return h;\n}\n\n// Si una foto falla (antihotlink u otra causa), se pide a traves de images.weserv.nl\n(function(){ var c = document.getElementById('tienda-catalogo'); if (c) c.addEventListener('error', function(e){ var t = e.target; if (t && t.tagName === 'IMG' && !t.getAttribute('data-resp')) { t.setAttribute('data-resp', '1'); t.src = 'https://images.weserv.nl/?url=' + encodeURIComponent(t.src.replace(/^https?:\\/\\//, '')); } }, true); })();\n\nfunction pintar(){ document.getElementById('tienda-catalogo').innerHTML = productos.slice(0, mostrados).map(crearTarjeta).join(''); }\nfunction cargarLote(){ if (mostrados >= productos.length) return; mostrados = Math.min(mostrados + POR_LOTE, productos.length); pintar(); }\nfunction fetchConTiempo(url, ms){\n  var ctrl = new AbortController();\n  var t = setTimeout(function(){ ctrl.abort(); }, ms);\n  return fetch(url, { signal: ctrl.signal }).then(function(r){ clearTimeout(t); if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status); return r.json(); });\n}\n\nfunction desdeTienda(){\n  return fetchConTiempo(COLECCION, 12000).then(function(d){\n    (d.products || []).forEach(function(p){\n      var vs = p.variants || [];\n      var disponibles = vs.filter(function(v){ return v.available; });\n      if (!disponibles.length) return;                       // no se muestran las agotadas\n      var v = disponibles[0];\n      var img = (p.images && p.images[0] && p.images[0].src) ? p.images[0].src : '';\n      if (img) img += (img.indexOf('?') === -1 ? '?' : '&') + 'width=400';\n      var antes = (v.compare_at_price && parseFloat(v.compare_at_price) > parseFloat(v.price)) ? euros(v.compare_at_price) : '';\n      productos.push({ titulo: p.title, url: TIENDA + '/es-es/products/' + p.handle, imagen: img, precio: euros(v.price), precio_antes: antes, descripcion: '' });\n    });\n  });\n}\nfunction desdeProxy(){\n  return fetchConTiempo(PROXY, 20000).then(function(d){ (d.productos || []).forEach(function(p){ productos.push(p); }); });\n}\nfunction finalizar(){\n  document.getElementById('loader').style.display = 'none';\n  cargarLote();\n  document.getElementById('web-oficial-container').style.display = 'block';\n  var s = document.getElementById('sentinel');\n  if (s && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {\n    new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){ if (entries[0].isIntersecting) cargarLote(); }, { rootMargin: '250px' }).observe(s);\n  }\n}\nfunction arrancar(){\n  desdeTienda().catch(function(){})\n    .then(function(){ if (!productos.length) return desdeProxy().catch(function(){}); })\n    .then(finalizar);\n}\nif (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', arrancar); else arrancar();\n})();\n</script>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">SI EL ARTÍCULO ESTÁ AGOTADO O NO REALIZAN ENVÍOS A TU DESTINO, CONTÁCTANOS: <a href=\"mailto:comercialyventas@gmail.com\">comercialyventas@gmail.com</a></span></div><br />",
 "fecha_copia": "2026-09-28T17:39:07.782Z"
}